      "category": "KismetCompiler",
      "signature": "RegisterClassDelegateProxiesFromBlueprint(Target)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FKismetCompilerContext*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Searches the function graphs and ubergraph pages for any delegate proxies,\nwhich are then registered with the compiler context.\nIf a \"captured\" variable is needed, then a new property will be added to the current class.\nIn this context, a captured variable is any target actor that the delegate will be called on."
